title: Antonio Hernando
is-pinned-card: true
card-image: img/spain/portrait_hernando.jpg
tags: sp_advisor
view-if: sanchez_leader = 1 and adv_hernando = 1
new-page: true
on-display: {!
if (typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.SpainGame) {
    window.SpainGame.renderVote(Q, 'sp-hernando-count', 'sanchez');
}
!}

= Antonio Hernando

Spokesperson of the parliamentary group and a central negotiator. Hernando lives by arithmetic: who votes yes, who abstains, who can be moved. Faction: Institutionalists. Loyal to the leadership, for now.

His current count for your investiture:

{!<div id="sp-hernando-count"></div>!}

- @cs_channel
- @group
- @pnv
- @fx_inst_0
- @fx_inst_1
- @root: Back

@cs_channel
title: Work the Ciudadanos channel
subtitle: Talks with Ciudadanos advance; Podemos notices.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: cs_talks += 1; rel_cs += 6; rel_up -= 3; advisor_action_timer = 2; month_actions += 1; last_advisor_action = 1

Hernando knows Ciudadanos's parliamentary team well. The talks move a step forward.

@group
title: Hold the parliamentary group together
subtitle: Lower dissent among Institutionalists and Modernisers.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: institutionalists_dissent -= 6; modernisers_dissent -= 3; sanchez_authority += 3; advisor_action_timer = 2; month_actions += 1; last_advisor_action = 1

A week of meetings with deputies, one by one. Nobody leaks for a while.

@pnv
title: Sound out the PNV
subtitle: Better relations with the Basque nationalists.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: rel_pnv += 10; advisor_action_timer = 2; month_actions += 1; last_advisor_action = 1

Aitor Esteban is courteous and noncommittal. That, from the PNV, is a good sign.

